From 5d6320bb3b073c1012574ca85ff9f794bb8017e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:52:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/78] Port the intro with input, timing and the credits
 screen

Ports H007 (intro: picture loading with fades, credits, $02CE..$09D8),
H010 event polling ($0882), RAWKEY conversion ($043C) and wait for key
($0974), H042+$0300, H011+$010C, H044 screen frame ($00C8, $01C2,
$02D8), H034+$0178 and H049+$012A (8x8 tiles), H030+$0B6C, and the
GetMsg/ReplyMsg/WaitPort, Delay, WaitTOF, SetPointer and AvailMem
adapters.

On the host, SDL keyboard and mouse events become IDCMP messages with
Amiga raw key codes, Delay and WaitTOF pace the program, and
COK_SCREENSHOT_AT saves frames at given times. Audio (H043) is not
ported yet: its two calls are skipped with a warning. The intro now
plays fully and the program reaches the Play/Demo prompt.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
